{
    "title": "Freaky Clown : Town Mystery",
    "description": "There\u2019s a creepy clown in the neighborhood that always acted spooky and suspicious in scary horror game. He sneaks at night, look for easy prey with his scary evil eyes and grabs them when no one is around the town. The clown in scary horror games is so sneaky that no one has ever heard anyone scream when he kidnaps his prey. Kids in the town have named his as \u201cFreaky Clown\u201d and remains biggest mystery of the town in clown mystery games. \u201cGumbo the Clown\u201d was always suspected but there was no evidence against that self acclaimed joker clown. This man in horror game 3d always managed to escape from the clutches of the police. The Mystery of missing kids terrorized the neighborhood and it continued to spread horror in the hearts of the people.\r\n\r\nIn Freaky Clown : Scary horror Game on one terrifying night Gary and Martin were hanging out to grab some ice cream. Gary went inside the shop and on his way back he saw the Scary Clown Kidnapping his friend Martin. Terror filled his heart due to the fear of losing his friend. Gary mustered up the courage and decided to save his friend and other poor souls from the evil scary clown in mystery game. Help Gary to sneak into the Clowns Den and save everyone from the scary horror and evil grasp of the scary horror clown in mystery game. In the scary horror creepy clown game you will find yourself in a mystery of scary clown, and the adventure of finding secrets in clown games.\r\n\r\nTake an action in horror mystery game and save your best friends from the scary horror clown, find out the mystery & origin of the freaky clown by getting hints and clues. You have to be very smart to get escape from horror clown and save your friends by secretly finding town mystery. You have to visit different horror places of creepy clown to win the challenging missions of freaky clown town mystery in clown escape games.\r\n\r\nCan you solve the evil mystery in scary horror game of this scary town and face the freaky clown and his horrors alone? Take on this horror adventure and play \u201c Freaky Clown : Town Mystery \u201c for clown escape and discover the evil plans of the creepy clown in mystery game. Experience the thriller adventure in the most Scary Horror Game of 2022 and reveal the identity of the masked man. Who is Freaky Clown ?\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n-Ghost Mode for Real Thrilling Experience\r\n\r\n-Easy and Engaging Controls\r\n\r\n-Scary and Spooky Mystery Town Environment\r\n\r\n-Suspense and Thrill Filled Music\r\n\r\n-Variety of Scary Levels",
    "descriptionHTML": "There\u2019s a creepy clown in the neighborhood that always acted spooky and suspicious in scary horror game. He sneaks at night, look for easy prey with his scary evil eyes and grabs them when no one is around the town. The clown in scary horror games is so sneaky that no one has ever heard anyone scream when he kidnaps his prey. Kids in the town have named his as \u201cFreaky Clown\u201d and remains biggest mystery of the town in clown mystery games. \u201cGumbo the Clown\u201d was always suspected but there was no evidence against that self acclaimed joker clown. This man in horror game 3d always managed to escape from the clutches of the police. The Mystery of missing kids terrorized the neighborhood and it continued to spread horror in the hearts of the people.<br><br>In Freaky Clown : Scary horror Game on one terrifying night Gary and Martin were hanging out to grab some ice cream. Gary went inside the shop and on his way back he saw the Scary Clown Kidnapping his friend Martin. Terror filled his heart due to the fear of losing his friend. Gary mustered up the courage and decided to save his friend and other poor souls from the evil scary clown in mystery game. Help Gary to sneak into the Clowns Den and save everyone from the scary horror and evil grasp of the scary horror clown in mystery game. In the scary horror creepy clown game you will find yourself in a mystery of scary clown, and the adventure of finding secrets in clown games.<br><br>Take an action in horror mystery game and save your best friends from the scary horror clown, find out the mystery &amp; origin of the freaky clown by getting hints and clues. You have to be very smart to get escape from horror clown and save your friends by secretly finding town mystery. You have to visit different horror places of creepy clown to win the challenging missions of freaky clown town mystery in clown escape games.<br><br>Can you solve the evil mystery in scary horror game of this scary town and face the freaky clown and his horrors alone? Take on this horror adventure and play \u201c Freaky Clown : Town Mystery \u201c for clown escape and discover the evil plans of the creepy clown in mystery game. Experience the thriller adventure in the most Scary Horror Game of 2022 and reveal the identity of the masked man. Who is Freaky Clown ?<br><br>Features:<br><br>-Ghost Mode for Real Thrilling Experience<br><br>-Easy and Engaging Controls<br><br>-Scary and Spooky Mystery Town Environment<br><br>-Suspense and Thrill Filled Music<br><br>-Variety of Scary Levels",
